# FLOW system spec — the founder's portable system, deliberately untracked.
# Wildcarded: the file carries its version in the name (FLOW_SYSTEM_v2.2.md),
# and matches in any directory. See docs/DECISIONS.md ADR-015.
FLOW_SYSTEM*.md

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Environment
.env
.env.local

# Signing keys. The updater's private key signs every release, and a leaked one
# is not recoverable — anybody holding it can sign an "update" that installs
# whatever they like on every machine running this application.
#
# Belt and braces rather than paranoia: the key belongs in ~/.tauri and never in
# a repository, and this one was written into the working tree once already, by
# a `%USERPROFILE%` that never expanded. The public half is wilfully committed —
# it is in tauri.conf.json — so only the private one is matched here.
*.key

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
